{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_023_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:13c7c96b9e075e337ead45cb742264e9137cd89a0931179297fba908d2e96f0f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef44355f8d726df5cc09457ef068fa5ee03aebbc39e632c759d6e5f0983bb2e",
      "text": "辛苦啦，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我把情人节的回礼带来啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1479792e8309fd4f82e0e90c5ea2271194453bdb35b5bbbc10b5d1b5966ea71b",
      "text": "给！快收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6e9bf673e6b00da85ecdb7e6c594b97284ffbc30ba81cc856d601be8d930615",
      "text": "我逛了好几家店，找到了这个绝对能让你开心的\n好东西哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d164e22b0e44da5566ed283beefd835796bc5cc56d7fe26046998c810af5db9c",
      "text": "情人节收到的巧克力超好吃的！\n谢谢你送我最棒的巧克力啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5c45acd6e8f8994f2ad1c996d601a71ad3ee138a4e12a7d8e8c607e9cbf2f5a",
      "text": "我的心意要是能传达给制作人的话，\n我就很高兴啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e699745d39956991502d9b756f0705b8cce00c3c2a425694d6293250c51412f5",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，白色情人节快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb8ad2fb7530c510b516dda76b914481f98e024c635770873d781fa4f6417e7",
      "text": "情人节的巧克力，超级好吃哦。\n所以呢，这是回礼。快收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f6b2067c32732fd6d69f85857d0fb32535b4f6261de867f8aa9fce8b04d1d51",
      "text": "话说啊，等会儿有空吗？\n一起出去转转吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e4817c817123dc777d4821e1847281baf9a7f54996ba4b31fd9d3249665604a",
      "text": "我平时常去的那家甜甜圈店，\n推出了白色情人节限定的新品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7eda3457775bd3ce59cdb73d9c3c5a17c78553fbeca117a96dec949d25969ff",
      "text": "难得有这个机会，我想和\n●●●●プロデューサー一起吃嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c15884b41716e0977116aea593e75ee494f3c2be979e5fddcb859757562c5dc9",
      "text": "好吃的东西，果然还是想一起吃啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7a0deb41262b75962b5750dd984609b8114b6d05ee3ad99b5022294b6f18144",
      "text": "而且你看，●●●●プロデューサー平时\n看起来总是一副很忙的样子对吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b32bb4e0efbdeb7c91c16d87ea75c809e121d650cebd6bc349a8b948136635e",
      "text": "哪怕能稍微转换一下心情也好啊——\n我是这么想的……怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000049:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79acf2771a1527980ea27367bc448cea6a80c3866790de208962eb6c46c747a1",
      "text": "真的可以吗？非常感谢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000050:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:097dcf1eb2f8c35540d809bd7970ae49eea5c43b08598c7d0111c3a6923894e8",
      "text": "务必！我们一起去吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_023_22:5_02_023_22_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8db658363475db5d77a36e30ae0a7e6360e87dcbb01aca07e2e7feea07ef7eb",
      "text": "那就这么定了！\n事不宜迟，我们马上出发吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
